# A shaped drive on hole 1 of the test course on the TX: the fourth app
# button (hard4) picks a fade, the 5-way aims a degree left and the centre
# does the three swing clicks, 95 % power with the snap on time. Then the
# other app buttons: hard2 opens the map and closes it, hard3 opens the
# scorecard and closes it. Start it on the tee view once it's drawn.
# Clicks after each swing start are 250 ms later than the meter times above: on the TX in Frond
# the meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show. Frond's TX slows under load, so power varies.
0 key-down hard4
80 key-up hard4
300 key-down hard4
380 key-up hard4
800 key-down left
860 key-up left
1500 snapshot "{out}/s1-aim.png"
2000 key-down center
2060 key-up center
3200 key-down center
3260 key-up center
3910 key-down center
3970 key-up center
5750 snapshot "{out}/s1-flight.png"
8750 snapshot "{out}/s1-roll.png"
10750 snapshot "{out}/s1-result.png"
11250 snapshot "{out}/s1-result2.png"
20250 snapshot "{out}/s2-aim.png"
21250 key-down hard2
21330 key-up hard2
24250 snapshot "{out}/map.png"
24750 key-down hard2
24830 key-up hard2
28250 snapshot "{out}/back.png"
28750 key-down hard3
28830 key-up hard3
30250 snapshot "{out}/card.png"
30750 key-down hard3
30830 key-up hard3
33250 snapshot "{out}/after-card.png"
33750 key-down hard1
33810 key-up hard1
35000 snapshot "{out}/hard1-meter.png"
